# The image ships no project files: every tool is downloaded from its pinned
# release inside the build, and the repository is bind-mounted at run time
# (CI mounts it at /__w/<repo>/<repo>). Ignoring everything keeps the build
# context at ~1 file, so a checkout with a site/ tree or coverage profiles in
# it does not get shipped to the daemon on every build.
*
!Dockerfile
